				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d2b329e animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="d2b329e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-box-wrapper">

			
						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							1503						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						The completion of the building was entrusted to Cristoforo da Milano and Girolamo da Pasino, while the sculptures of the facade were commissioned to Gabriele Frisoni.					</p>
				
			</div>
			
		</div>
